ble:true})` presumably. Let me verify `Xt` and `Bt` quickly. Also verify the version string of htmx.\\n\\nActually, the beforeSwap cancel path: `if (!ae(r,\\\"htmx:beforeSwap\\\",m)) return;` — ae returns `o` = `e.dispatchEvent(r)` result (false if defaultPrevented) — so preventDefault → dispatchEvent returns false → ae returns false → return early → NO SWAP. Confirmed cancelable. (Also extensions onEvent check `!r.defaultPrevented`.) Good.\\n\\nLet me verify Xt creates a cancelable Event and the htmx version string.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"text","text":"Key finding: in this vendored htmx, `htmx:beforeSwap` is dispatched on the swap *target*, and the request origin is carried in `detail.requestConfig.elt`. Let me confirm the event is cancelable and check the htmx version."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a81b75c521d84300b8b9b0bb","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/phaedrus/development/misty-step/canopy/.forest/worktrees/1788550107325557414-fixer && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\nsrc = open('static/htmx.min.js').read()\n# htmx version\nm = re.search(r'version:\"([^\"]+)\"', src)\nprint('version:', m.group(1) if m else '?')\n# Xt (makeEvent / Event creation)\nfor name in [r'function Xt\\(', r'Xt=']:\n    for mm in re.finditer(name, src):\n        s = max(0, mm.start()-80)\n        e = min(len(src), mm.end()+220)\n        print('...', src[s:e], '...')\n        break\n# confirm requestConfig key used in merge for beforeSwap: search 'requestConfig'\nprint('requestConfig occurrences:', src.count('requestConfig'))\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","usage":{"input":678,"output":8258,"cacheRead":72960,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":7245,"totalTokens":81896,"cost":{"input":0.000033900000000000004,"output":0.0008258000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0007296000000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0015893}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788550371026,"responseId":"gen-1788550371-O3FAG9